1
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:07,620
Today we're going to
practice Breathe Light,

2
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:12,270
Let your shoulders
soften and relax your jaw

3
00:00:18,407 --> 00:00:23,027
Now begin to bring a little
softness into your breathing.

4
00:00:29,395 --> 00:00:35,395
Now we're going to experiment
with breathing a little less air.

5
00:00:36,255 --> 00:00:39,605
Not necessarily breathing
slower but taking

6
00:00:39,655 --> 00:00:43,325
in a smaller amount of
air with each breath.

7
00:00:53,474 --> 00:00:58,084
Soften the inhale, relax the exhale

8
00:01:08,314 --> 00:01:14,534
And now slowly release any
control over your breathing.

9
00:01:21,510 --> 00:01:24,020
Whatever you notice is okay.

